{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c170746fefd845dae5cf6e038d54055b78ac09c774d0fabdd599de12c65e35af", "ja": "いよいよ新曲のレコーディング。歌い方に悩\nむ環をサポートする育。その姿を見て、桃子\nは育が大人だと褒めるも、なんかえらそう！\nと育と環にくすぐりの刑に処される。3人の\n様子を温かく見守るプロデューサー。", "zh": "终于要录制新歌了。育支持着为唱法\n烦恼的环。看到这一幕后，桃子夸育像个\n大人，却说“感觉好像很了不起嘛！”结果被育和环处以挠痒痒之刑。制作人则温柔地注视着3人的\n样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7df4835cfa44b263c6e31de842ecc00195e895b7ace33a1792933487541ca78e", "ja": "（今日はいよいよ、新曲のレコーディングだ！\n3人とも、緊張してないかな……）", "zh": "（今天终于要录制新歌了！不知道3个人有没有紧张……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "46f169f22519c6cf25b7692cb4bc35e70241d22f7162e5a599cafd4809a7b833", "ja": "んー？　さっき注意されたところ、\nどうやって歌えばいいかわからないぞ……。", "zh": "嗯——？刚才被提醒的地方，不知道该怎么唱才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "81102f91a22a58bb5dfc3e27c11dfa7baebe65f4e4e92fe871d2cdf1f910b889", "ja": "さっきの……\nああ、すこし大人っぽさを出すようにってところ？", "zh": "刚才说的……\n啊，你是指要唱得稍微成熟一点的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "b84f0c86b1e6b79662213df76f0573344ade439a47e4d784514822bae3e6248e", "ja": "うーん……たとえば、誰か、\n大人っぽい人を参考にしてみるとか？", "zh": "嗯……比如说，参考一下某个看起来成熟的人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "8c59d71195f8d76b960935f80910ef399b30d65dd3744349a7aef39ecdb0d72e", "ja": "どうかな、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "怎么样，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "154010066e929c44e25e4085eaa1116ca6a236c05336e1487a5ae88b83bfeaee", "ja": "うん、いいんじゃないか？　環よりすこし大人……\nそうだな、中学生か高校生くらいでいいと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得不错吧？比环稍微成熟一点……\n对了，我觉得初中生或高中生左右就可以了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "53fafc9f26283c59f946fb44765737b27e6fa39ea960d501812a768e1fcdd00f", "ja": "そっか……わかった。たまき、うみみとか、\n劇場のみんなのマネしてみる！　育、ありがとー！", "zh": "这样啊……知道了。环要试着模仿海美，还有剧场里的大家！育，谢谢你——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "eea8ef72e64745596562b267591b77025133d7537ca5890099de127c22aea5e7", "ja": "ううん、どういたしまして！", "zh": "不客气，不用谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "1358a5dffb1ee76ec315332fe5f93235b6cdba30f3eb592c408e4d2eb956535b", "ja": "はあ……育って、\n自分のことちっともわかってないよね。", "zh": "唉……育，你真是一点都不了解自己呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "0c54a4d3da281cf9921aa7252d5485dbd9e5bea9544af8d3154b8686ef9ba1cc", "ja": "子どもっぽいことで悩んでたなんて、\n信じられないな。", "zh": "真难以置信，\n居然会为了那么小孩子气的事情烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "8f679aff128b8c119626cd66d07d82f7fba842a6de922c5f6b5e482a15e5e1bb", "ja": "うう……。で、でも、わたしにとっては、\n真剣な悩みだったんだもん！", "zh": "呜呜……可、可是，对我来说，\n当时真的很苦恼嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "ab08532e3c7c4d06aadaab2834e838a5db1511e848a04ed94380bcda3a9904ca", "ja": "環のスタイルがうらやましいとか、\n桃子が大人っぽいとか、いろいろ言ってたけど……。", "zh": "之前还说过羡慕环的身材、觉得桃子很成熟之类的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "cc47864b21a429b592e3cc847116018366449c853a28a9dcd0131a7c9433c66c", "ja": "そうやって桃子たちのことしっかり見て、アドバイス\nできる子は、子どもっぽいって言わないと思うよ。", "zh": "能这样认真观察桃子她们、还会给出建议的孩子，我觉得可不能说是孩子气哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "926e59120ac996f496d8476fa275af0004f3800205b3cc469610a3a90b26f2e1", "ja": "そうでしょ？　お兄ちゃん。", "zh": "对吧？哥哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "265b9075007a5423d2709b9153f6fbb41a65d7f6a366d54ae988af4fa4af0499", "ja": "はは、そうだな！　他人のいいところを\n冷静に評価できる育は、大人っぽいと俺も思うよ。", "zh": "哈哈，没错！我也觉得，能够冷静地评价别人优点的育，很有大人的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "3e1cc5163804ac152da2d5a86191ce7543ef42b04671e4715f020e595e00d6d7", "ja": "たまきも、いっぱいほめられた！　育は\nたまきのこと、なんでも知っててすごいぞ～！", "zh": "环也被夸了好多次！育什么都知道，真厉害呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "9204b88556133fc8457f596bcaa517c0eebf78b25812e8f252c8bc9e03150f4d", "ja": "そ、そうかな……えへへ。", "zh": "是、是这样吗……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "c1de6b27ad02b98adf4789035ece0b39fde50371d8f83bdc0f233651bd3d0099", "ja": "まあ、今回は環にも驚かされたけどね。\n正直、見直しちゃったかな。", "zh": "不过，这次也被环吓了一跳呢。\n说实话，还真是对她刮目相看了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "d2c4d30641102e54822d5805e8be9b4db23b362907747244b8c65d24cfb83841", "ja": "環がリーダーなんて、最初は不安だったけど……\nけっこう、ちゃんとしてたと思うし。", "zh": "一开始让环当队长，我还有点不放心，不过……\n我觉得她表现得还挺像样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "b9758c20f32ff4422288452d4947d223930866ae4b9409373cc60e8e86410335", "ja": "むー……。\nももこ、なんかちょっとえらそう……。", "zh": "唔……桃子好像有点趾高气扬……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "b9f3b4d0213b1de980a3c86e34ffa99d01951a58b0ca296835d0c2b8cfe2afd5", "ja": "桃子ちゃんも、わたしたちと同じ子どもなのに……。", "zh": "桃子明明也和我们一样是小孩子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "a49f77be195bf7cf4f5afad7405a77eceb09e9a0a727ca8365414cdd3f4a3a15", "ja": "な、なに？　ふたりとも、その目は……。\n……も、桃子、ちょっと外の空気吸ってくる。", "zh": "怎、怎么了？你们两个，那是什么眼神……\n……桃、桃子出去透口气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "a767e9dbf0660168cb3a36ec62b2099f2897df0d4fa0b397771c1c2cac669cee", "ja": "あっ、にげたぞ！\n育、つかまえてくすぐりの刑にしちゃお！", "zh": "啊，逃掉了！\n育，我们抓住她，给她来个挠痒痒惩罚吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "cbd0a1575d326a91fb883ffefc83ddda590ac61b2e3e2d9b1e0f9b4044d3f6ba", "ja": "わかった！　環ちゃん、\nはさみうちでいくよ！", "zh": "明白了！环，我们前后夹击！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "3b9f155941cff8cde250915c8d0e8f578ec1b854065e4ff1cc4a8631f4a12296", "ja": "きゃあっ！？　ちょ、ちょっともう！\nふたりとも、ほんと子どもなんだから……！", "zh": "呀！？ 等、等一下啦！\n你们两个真是的，简直跟小孩子一样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1027_p", "source_sha256": "b42dc0941f783c1e36242609bf6d3f411c28405edb37d4b70513b6f9800265e9", "ja": "あっ、3人とも！\nスタジオ内で暴れちゃダメだぞ！　……はぁ。", "zh": "啊，3个人都在！\n不许在摄影棚里闹腾！……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "e1b0d0b8a09e4713a2d79206c52229973076afa1c5335cc8c805c353990c49fc", "ja": "（3人のバランスは、見事に調和している。\nステージで披露するのが、本当に楽しみだな……！）", "zh": "（3人的配合，达成了绝妙的和谐。真期待能在舞台上呈现出来啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
